          "usability": "Route/approach labels, directional threat prompts, phase labels, auto reload and transparent assist counts were useful. Untreated rear enemies created pressure while focus stayed on coils.",
          "readability": "Objective, health/ammo, target feedback and results were legible at 844x390. World signage and distant enemies were much smaller and lower contrast; overlays occupy appreciable scene space."
